WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:09.000
Students in China tie their hair to the ceiling
to prevent themselves falling asleep whilst

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.280
studying.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:15.870
Welcome to RIF

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:21.939
Traces of cocoa and nicotine found in some
Egyptian mummies have let to speculations

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:28.360
that Ancient Egyptians may have traveled to
the new world.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:36.399
The brain consumes 20% of the body's energy,
yet it only accounts for 2% of our total body

00:00:36.399 --> 00:00:37.399
weight.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:43.570
The engine of the BMW M5 is so quiet the company
plays fake engine noises through the car's

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:47.780
speakers to remind drivers of their cars performance.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.820
One quarter of the bones in your body are
in your feet.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:59.989
The tip of a bullwhip moves so fast that when
you hear it crack, the sound it makes is actually

00:00:59.989 --> 00:01:01.879
a tiny sonic boom.

00:01:01.879 --> 00:01:07.960
"Almost" is the longest word in the English
language with all the letters in alphabetical

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:08.960
order.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.159
Human thigh bones are stronger than concrete.

00:01:12.159 --> 00:01:17.110
Earth is the only planet in our solar system
not named after a god.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:24.630
One in Five adults believe that aliens are
hiding on our planet disguised as humans.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:38.249
And finally, there are no naturally occurring
blue foods, even blueberries are purple!

